WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — game-engines (30s) Narrator Charlie

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.020
Standard floating-point math diverges across Apple libSystem,

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.348
Linux glibc, and Windows UCRT between ticks 10 and 37.

3
00:00:07.468 --> 00:00:11.524
Separating Q32.32 fixed-point simulation from GPU rendering draws

4
00:00:11.524 --> 00:00:14.955
a sharp line where exactness ends and tolerance begins.

5
00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:20.907
Six machines pass 100,000-tick and one-hour 216,000-tick replays with zero diffs,

6
